### This file contains information relevant to Ontology Explained, Casey Hart's YouTube channel.
### :CaseyHart and the PPP episodes (:PPP-Episode3.5) are defined in ../ppp/podcast_ontology_data.ttl.
### Videos, playlists and sources are named "Source-" + uuid5(best identifier), the same rule as the PPP file,
### so a video cited on PPP and the video described here are the same node.
### Each block starts with a comment giving the YouTube ID and title.

:OntologyExplained a :YouTubeChannel ;
	:name "Ontology Explained: Philosophy and AI" ;
	:createdBy :CaseyHart ;
	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCp1fkZgvafg05wqe1Rc2UlA"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	rdfs:comment """Ontology Explained is a place that provides clear, interesting, and edifying discussions about topics involving philosophy and artificial intelligence.""" ;
	:description """After earning my PhD in philosophy, I found my way into AI as an ontologist. I'm here to evangelize, educate, demystify, and hopefully entertain viewers at the intersection of philosophy and AI. My videos will include general introductions to dense or interesting topics, tutorials to create your own ontologies, business insights into the value of technologies, and more philosophical things.""" ;
.


#### Playlists

# playlist PLIHlyoU28t5_gsMf8EkmnQVSHefbR3xqz · Intro to Ontology
:Source-1c3f9f59-deb4-5fe5-94fa-a85120e597fc a :Playlist ;
