	:description """For ontology novices and veterans alike, this playlist walks you through how this ontologist thinks about what ontologies are, what they are good for, how they relate to AI, and to go about building your own.""" ;
.

# playlist PLIHlyoU28t59kTr-0dDS6S_clDkCfXHy_ · Ontology Terms You NEED To Know
