# w9s16ICbndg · Three Metaphors for Ontology
:Source-e42e2494-8832-5a87-a4d9-4c1f9af17b86 a :Video ;
	:name "Three Metaphors for Ontology" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT13M51S"^^xsd:duration] ;
