# qWfdBtgP33A · Three Signs You Need Ontology
:Source-c93e4d9f-924e-5f19-a795-8c534ec15b40 a :Video ;
	:name "Three Signs You Need Ontology" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT6M38S"^^xsd:duration] ;
	:releaseDate [:universalDate "2024-10-29"^^xsd:date ; :universalDateTime "2024-10-29T06:01:06-07:00"^^xsd:dateTime] ;
	:partOf :OntologyExplained, :Source-1c3f9f59-deb4-5fe5-94fa-a85120e597fc ;	# Intro to Ontology
	:createdBy :CaseyHart ;
	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWfdBtgP33A"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	:description """We've covered what ontology is and how to think about it. But perhaps the most important question hasn't been answered: how do you know if ontology is worth using? When can you get value out of an ontology? In this video, Casey lays out three major signs/symptoms that ontology is right for you. You should consider an ontology if you really value understanding, reusability, and explainability.

Honorable mentions that didn't hit the top three:
- Reasoning
- LLM Shortcomings
- Expertise Matters
- You need a controlled vocabulary or to standardize terms
- You want to iteratively improve your organization's knowledge""" ;
	:cites :Source-e42e2494-8832-5a87-a4d9-4c1f9af17b86 ;	# Three Metaphors for Ontology
.

# 09lqXPzr334 · RDF Terms You Need to Know
