	:description """This is part of a crash course in vocabulary that will get you started building your own OWL ontologies. In this video, I present the Resource Description Framework (RDF) term you need to know, rdf:type. There's also an honorable mention to rdf:Property.""" ;
	:cites :Source-d5b48077-11f4-529c-95c0-2a75f3062f73 ;	# OWL Basics
