# jshuHBy7Xzw · RDFS Terms You Need to Know
:Source-bfd72c3b-5401-5757-9d18-5166d3a168a0 a :Video ;
	:name "RDFS Terms You Need to Know" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT9M26S"^^xsd:duration] ;
	:releaseDate [:universalDate "2024-11-16"^^xsd:date ; :universalDateTime "2024-11-16T20:48:01-08:00"^^xsd:dateTime] ;
	:partOf :OntologyExplained, :Source-22f2e7b2-fe8c-5c88-967e-c60d3167d172 ;	# Ontology Terms You NEED To Know
	:createdBy :CaseyHart ;
	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jshuHBy7Xzw"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	:description """This is part of a crash course in vocabulary that will get you started building your own OWL ontologies. In this video, I present the Resource Description Framework Schema (RDFS) terms you need to know, including rdfs:subPropertyOf, rdfs:subClassOf, rdfs:domain, and rdfs:range. We also cover rdfs:comment and rdfs:label.""" ;
.

