# MIarwhB_jVY · Blank Nodes
:Source-1e651540-a751-5b95-8e2a-49b50bfad66d a :Video ;
	:name "Blank Nodes" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT14M26S"^^xsd:duration] ;
	:releaseDate [:universalDate "2025-08-01"^^xsd:date ; :universalDateTime "2025-08-01T12:22:57-07:00"^^xsd:dateTime] ;
	:partOf :OntologyExplained ;
	:createdBy :CaseyHart ;
	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIarwhB_jVY"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	:description """We use existential statements all the time: I know somebody. The coffee is in a cup. The event happened some time. How can we express this in OWL/RDF? We use blank nodes. Today, I'll introduce the concept and show you how they work.

Stay tuned for a coming video about their dangers. Blank nodes are super useful, but they can get you into trouble.""" ;
.

# gtomgO8G--I · The Dangers of Blank Nodes
:Source-ae2c5058-acbd-5094-a0d7-d4ff98d9d8e0 a :Video ;
	:name "The Dangers of Blank Nodes" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT12M20S"^^xsd:duration] ;
	:releaseDate [:universalDate "2025-08-01"^^xsd:date ; :universalDateTime "2025-08-01T15:25:43-07:00"^^xsd:dateTime] ;
	:partOf :OntologyExplained ;
	:createdBy :CaseyHart ;
	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gtomgO8G--I"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	:description """You watched my blank nodes video. You're excited, I get it. But don't go throwing them everywhere yet! Watch this video, where I talk about the two biggest drawbacks of blank nodes--they aren't referenceable, and they are not conducive to idempotent loading processes.

I conclude the video by discussing the calculus: to blank node, or not to blank node.""" ;
	:cites :Source-1e651540-a751-5b95-8e2a-49b50bfad66d ;	# Blank Nodes
.

# RUdOTg15jDc · OWL Restrictions
:Source-0487f73f-e2d1-5e4e-a1ee-d220c7c701ca a :Video ;
	:name "OWL Restrictions" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT20M9S"^^xsd:duration] ;
