	:createdBy :CaseyHart ;
	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8F8brEi-G24"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	:description """This video kicks off a new series inspired by the “let’s play” genre—except instead of games, we’re building a chess ontology together! In this first episode, we set up the base .ttl file, experiment with some natural language scaffolding, sketch out what the data might look like, and start defining core vocabulary like :ChessPlayer and :MagnusCarlsen.""" ;
	:cites :Source-bbbe9b45-c4dc-56f4-ab18-ac86a6a365e8 ;	# chess.ttl (the Let's Build a Chess Ontology repository)
