# PwSaTruXwhQ · Thought Experiment: How Intelligent Are Mushrooms?
:Source-635ed044-e4d2-5a23-93e5-b15bcaa6b9ad a :Video ;
	:name "Thought Experiment: How Intelligent Are Mushrooms?" ;
