# sRqatx5xs_o · Merging Equivalent Concepts in OWL
:Source-e97c37ed-bb69-5dbf-af02-6efdedcc1745 a :Video ;
	:name "Merging Equivalent Concepts in OWL" ;
	:hasDuration [:duration "PT20M4S"^^xsd:duration] ;
	:releaseDate [:universalDate "2026-01-23"^^xsd:date ; :universalDateTime "2026-01-23T12:38:12-08:00"^^xsd:dateTime] ;
