	:url-Youtube "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PcsJPrQUoJ4"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	:description """In this video, I have the amazing privilege to meet and interview Heather Hedden. The author of the Accidental Taxonomist, Heather has wide and deep experience in the field of semantics. She's practically a celebrity. We discuss the field in general, how to enter it, what she finds interesting, and compare and contrast ontology and taxonomy.""" ;
